MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

February 21, 2023
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-15-23 for an Agreement between the City of
Cheyenne and Inman Roofing, Inc. for the Sanitation Transfer Station Reroof
project
_____________________________________________
Bid #S-15-23 was solicited for the Sanitation Transfer Station Reroof project.  A project diagram is
included for reference.

Five (5) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Bids were received from:
1. Weathercraft Co. of Scottsbluff-Gering.  Gering, NE.
2. Alpine Roofing Ltd.  Denver, CO.
3. Colorado Moisture Control, Inc.  Denver, CO.
4. Front Range Roofing Systems.  Greeley, CO.
5. Inman Roofing, Inc.  Cheyenne, WY.

The bids were reviewed by Craig LaVoy (Public Works), and Steve Gaer (Facilities), and their
recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Inman Roofing, Inc.

The Bid Award amount is requested for $373,730.00.

Funding:
023-14-1417-43-43501 (Solid Waste Fund / Improvements)
```

